---
description: Keep private research names and raw chats out of the product repo
alwaysApply: true
---

This workspace includes a research memories tree. The product repo must stay anonymized.

Never add to `hades-product`:
- Private first names from the research instance
- Raw conversation transcripts or message `content` / `reasoning` bodies
- Tokens, passphrases, danger words, numeric chat IDs, model keys

Allowed in `hades-product`:
- Architecture docs
- Module graph
- Aggregated stats (counts, sources, roles, date ranges)
- Field lists / schemas
- Redacted voice notes with names already stripped

Use `primary_user`, `person_id`, `partner`, `sister`, `virtual_friend` — not personal names.

If a command would print message bodies, do not run it in a form that gets committed.
